TI  - Virulence and horizontal transmission of <i>Metarhizium anisopliae</i> by the adults of the greenhouse whitefly <i>Trialeurodes vaporariorum</i> (Hemiptera: Aleyrodidae) and the efficacy of oil formulations against its nymphs
