TI  - Divergent roles of Rad4 and Rad23 homologs in <i>Metarhizium robertsii</i>'s resistance to solar ultraviolet damage
AU  - Zhang, Yi-Lu
AU  - Peng, Han
AU  - Zhang, Ke
AU  - Ying, Sheng-Hua
AU  - Feng, Ming-Guang
IS  - 9
VL  - 89
