TI  - Can Symbiotic Bacteria (<i>Xenorhabdus</i> and <i>Photorhabdus</i>) Be More Efficient than Their Entomopathogenic Nematodes against <i>Pieris rapae</i> and <i>Pentodon algerinus</i> Larvae?
