TI  - Expression of trypsin modulating oostatic factor (TMOF) in an entomopathogenic fungus increases its virulence towards Anopheles gambiae and reduces fecundity in the target mosquito
AU  - Kamareddine, Layla
AU  - Fan, Yanhua
AU  - Osta, Mike A
