TI  - Additive contributions of two manganese-cored superoxide dismutases (MnSODs) to antioxidation, UV tolerance and virulence of Beauveria bassiana
AU  - Xie, Xue-Qin
AU  - Li, Fang
AU  - Ying, Sheng-Hua
