TI  - A novel method for standardized application of fungal spore coatings for mosquito exposure bioassays
AU  - Farenhorst, Marit
AU  - Knols, Bart G J
VL  - 9
DA  - 2010/01//
PY  - 2010
T2  - Malaria journal
J2  - Malar J
