TI  - Projected economic losses due to vector and vector-borne parasitic diseases in livestock of India and its significance in implementing the concept of integrated practices for vector management
AU  - Narladkar, BW
IS  - 2
VL  - 11
DA  - 2018/02//
PY  - 2018
