TI  - Reviewing the ecological evidence base for management of emerging tropical zoonoses: Kyasanur Forest Disease in India as a case study
AU  - Burthe, Sarah J
AU  - Schäfer, Stefanie M
AU  - Asaaga, Festus A
AU  - Balakrishnan, Natrajan
