TI  - Profiling Destruxin Synthesis by Specialist and Generalist Metarhizium Insect Pathogens during Coculture with Plants
AU  - Barelli, Larissa
AU  - Behie, Scott W
AU  - Hu, Shasha
AU  - Bidochka, Michael J
