TI  - Influences of two coexisting endosymbionts, CI-inducing <i>Wolbachia</i> and male-killing <i>Spiroplasma</i>, on the performance of their host <i>Laodelphax striatellus</i> (Hemiptera: Delphacidae)
AU  - Yoshida, Kazuki
