TI  - Microbial Ecology of the Gut in Laboratory Stocks of the Migratory Grasshopper, Melanoplus sanguinipes (Fab.) (Orthoptera: Acrididae)
AU  - Mead, LJ
AU  - Khachatourians, GG
AU  - Jones, GA
IS  - 5
VL  - 54
DA  - 1988/05//
PY  - 1988
JO  - Applied and environmental microbiology
J2  - Appl Environ Microbiol
